  "description": "Our Copperhead EVO models offer powerful e-power and top-of-the-range features for the best possible off-road performance – and all at a great price. Whether as a full-suspension trail bike with innovative 4-link swingarm technology or as an agile hardtail for fast off-road adventures: this is where riding fun meets high-tech. The Bosch Performance Line CX Gen5 motor delivers plenty of thrust for steep climbs, while the high-quality monocoque frame with integrated MonkeyLink cornering light and Twinlight rear light ensures safety and style. Get on, feel the power – and make every trail your territory.",
